{"slug":"Universal-Script-FETHIUM-GUI-v1-Public-Release-70511","_id":"6927fd413591c739e7ce0166","title":"FETHIUM GUI v1 Public Release","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Hi! This is my new project. \nThis script will likely not be updated unless it gets views. This script was created by me (lolkidd) and my friend Bigpen. We poured our hearts into this project. We spent over a week writing the bypasses, so we're hoping for support. Yes, the script doesn't look like much, but its functionality is impressive. devlog: FLY BYPASS (glide) bypasses most anti-cheats. Speed ​​Bypass is written in the script description. Noclip is a bypass that freezes the player's hitbox, allowing them to move through blocks where needed and unfreeze. Flip & Escape - it's best to see for yourself what it does. :3 Void Jump creates blocks under the player, allowing them to jump in mid-air. It bypasses places that don't allow jumping (like Forsaken, Dandy's World, etc.). WARNING: VOID JUMP MAY BE DETECTED BY ANTI-CHEAT. Velocity jump and Ice turbo are created for place - Secret staycation. I'll post a new version of the script when it reaches 4k views. Spoilers: A Constructor feature might be added that will allow you to create YOUR OWN BYPASSES WITHIN THE SCRIPT, and it will be so easy that even a noob who doesn't know anything about Lua coding will be able to create their own bypass.","tags":["fe","fE","Fe","Bypass"],"script":"--Read description pls\n--Ss: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BNd83ptamTw\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/Dieofdark/6fe7c87da97646ee7dd8b5e42d437d2d/raw/gistfile1.txt\"))()","owner":{"_id":"676c38455b67ad1ada75c887","username":"ImKomodOrNEKOMOD","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6dacd65f67f